## Why This Is Asked

Tests understanding of SSPR configuration in Azure AD, MFA requirements, method selection, rollout strategy, monitoring, and rollback procedures.

## Key Concepts

- Self-service password reset (SSPR)
- MFA enrollment and authentication methods
- Rollout planning and rollback strategies
- Monitoring and auditing in Azure AD

## Code Example

```javascript
// Example: Check SSPR policy configuration via Microsoft Graph API
async function checkSSPRPolicy(graphClient) {
  try {
    const policy = await graphClient.api('/policies/authenticationMethodsPolicy')
      .get();
```

## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical app registration for a mobile app using PKCE with Azure AD, focusing on public client setup, permissions, and cleanup.

## Key Concepts

- Public client app registration
- Redirect URIs for mobile apps
- API permissions and consent
- PKCE flow basics
- Token validation and cleanup

## Code Example

```javascript
// MSAL config for a mobile app
const msalConfig = {
  auth: {
    clientId: "YOUR_CLIENT_ID",
    authority: "https://login.microsoftonline.com/YOUR_TENANT_ID",
    redirectUri: "com.example.app://auth"
  },
  cache: { cacheLocation: "localStorage" }
};
const loginRequest = { scopes: ["User.Read"] };
```

